  title: The Drowned Bell
  stages:
  - title: Rumour
    description: Healer Maren speaks of the Drowned Bell, silent since the flood.
    next: 1
  - title: A light for the marsh
    description: Blackmere is dark. Find a lantern, buy one at the inn, or craft
      one at the tinker's bench.
    next: 2
  - title: The crossing
    description: 'Get past Warden Hale''s gate, then cross the black water: earn
      Odd''s favour or mend the old punt.'
    next: 3
  - title: The drowned belfry
    description: Ring the bell with its clapper, or let it sleep.
    next: -1
